      "name": "觉得/认为 opinion, 打算/希望/决定 intention",
      "explain": "觉得 and 认为 both introduce an opinion (\"[I] feel/think that...\") — just say the subject, then 觉得/认为, then the opinion. 打算, 希望, and 决定 go before a verb phrase to show intention: \"plan to\", \"hope to\", \"decide to\".",
